# The images need the Cargo workspace and nothing else: its manifests and lockfile, the crates
# (migrations and openapi.json included), the query metadata the sqlx macros read offline
# (.sqlx/), and tools/ because Cargo refuses a workspace with a missing member. No apps/, docs/,
# deploy/, private .env files or target/. The public .env.example is embedded by the
# server's environment validation and must be present at compile time.
*
!.env.example
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!tools/
!.sqlx/

# Local credentials and build output remain private even inside an allowed source directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars*
**/*.tfplan
**/.terraform
**/node_modules
**/target
